@startuml
title DGM-USECASE-04 成果治理与身份消歧局部用例图\nFR09、FR15 / UC-08、UC-10
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FF
  BorderColor #537494
}

actor "门户管理者" as Owner
actor "治理管理员" as Admin

rectangle "OvO 学术成果分享平台：成果与身份治理" {
  usecase "UC-10\n治理成果与学者关系" as Govern
  usecase "治理成果与版本\nFR09-S01～S08" as Dedup
  usecase "核验身份与成果归属\nFR15-S01～S06、S08" as Identity
  usecase "UC-08\n确认、补录与纠正成果\nFR15-S07 接口" as Opinion
  usecase "核对证据与当前版本" as Evidence
  usecase "保留决定与审计证据" as Audit
}

Owner --> Opinion
Admin --> Govern
Admin --> Dedup
Admin --> Identity
Dedup ..> Evidence : <<include>>
Identity ..> Evidence : <<include>>
Dedup ..> Audit : <<include>>
Identity ..> Audit : <<include>>

note bottom of Govern
  本图只展开治理逻辑；门户认领审核
  另见 DGM-ACTIVITY-01。
end note
footer 依据：成员 D CodeArts XMI 中的局部用例；SRS V0.4 FR09、FR15，需成员复核
@enduml
